# Worldspine Wurm is discarded to the maximum hand size on turn 3 and its shuffle trigger goes on the stack; Bot2 answers with Ghost
# Vacuum, exiling it from the graveyard. The trigger finds the card gone (a new object in exile, CR 400.7) and shuffles nothing in: it
# stays exiled, and the library keeps its size.

[Bot1 Deck]
Worldspine Wurm
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ghost Vacuum
Island x15

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ghost Vacuum.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Discard(Worldspine Wurm)
Bot2.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Worldspine Wurm)
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Exile = Worldspine Wurm
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Library.Count = 9
